  m_text: "<size=18>- If              is selected, award <b>10 Free Games</b>.\n-
    During <b>Free Games</b>, over spins, more <b>Wilds</b>\r\n   are added to reels
    <b>2</b>-<b>4</b>.\n- <b>3</b> or more         re-triggers <b>+5 Free Games</b>.\n-                                                                      
    do <b>NOT</b> appear\n   during <b>Free Games</b>.</size>"
